  "stem": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861834-114651791852237200-7MrjRgE6btVeh61Wo8cFnNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXqtGA_o_FxwvCJbBp1-5Kpn\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">84</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">”消毒液、漂白粉等都是含氯的消毒剂，回答下列问题：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">Ⅰ．“</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">84</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">”消毒液的制备：利用下图装置制备</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">NaClO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">溶液</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"209\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/8/11/2c35c255-ef81-4d7c-a50b-e5fc7dcff805.png\" width=\"459\" /></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861834-114651791852237200-7MrjRgE6btVeh61Wo8cFnNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXqtGA_o_FxwvCJbBp1-5Kpn\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（1）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置甲中发生的反应化学方程式为</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"1\" size=\"7\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861834-114651791852237200-7MrjRgE6btVeh61Wo8cFnNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXqtGA_o_FxwvCJbBp1-5Kpn\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（2）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置丁用来收集纯净且干燥的氯气，进气口为</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"2\" size=\"7\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">填</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861834-114651791852237200-7MrjRgE6btVeh61Wo8cFnNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXqtGA_o_FxwvCJbBp1-5Kpn\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（3）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">若将装置甲中所产生气体直接通入戊中制备“</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">84</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消毒液”，则装置己中盛装的试剂为</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"3\" size=\"7\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">Ⅱ．“</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">84</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">”消毒液的分析</span></p><table style=\"width:150.69px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;border-collapse: collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">84</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消毒液</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效成分：</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">NaClO</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相对分子质量：</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">74.5)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量分数：</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">37.25%</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">密度：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7f4a6db9b38dfcfd16eb3de28275c48b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"\"><span></span></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861834-114651791852237200-7MrjRgE6btVeh61Wo8cFnNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXqtGA_o_FxwvCJbBp1-5Kpn\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（4）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">欲将上述“</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">84</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消毒液”原液稀释配制成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2b0327b5725d3ea9e6fa93fcb4015de3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">NaClO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">溶液。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">①稀释时，需要取用</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"4\" size=\"7\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">mL</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">84</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消毒液”原液；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">②配制过程中，需要用到的玻璃仪器有烧杯、玻璃棒、胶头滴管、量筒、</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"5\" size=\"7\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">③化学实验要注意安全。在配制</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">NaClO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">溶液实验中，最后一步需要完成的操作安全图标是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"6\" size=\"7\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">填序号</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p><table style=\"width:555px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;border-collapse: collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"width:141px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"75\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/8/11/753f8656-ce6a-43a0-8d21-3a43948ba90c.png\" width=\"86\" /></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"76\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/8/11/490884e6-e86a-4881-b876-68086c541444.png\" width=\"88\" /></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"76\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/8/11/d7139366-5854-4c75-bd7a-898aa04a1010.png\" width=\"85\" /></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"75\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/8/11/ddea40be-9148-4c6b-a38f-15736f9b6e82.png\" width=\"77\" /></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"74\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/8/11/dbc3bd74-cca1-4f34-9d58-f683d83c09a1.png\" width=\"86\" /></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:141px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">①</span></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">②</span></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">③</span></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">④</span></p></td><td style=\"width:150px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">⑤</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">④配制过程中若出现以下情况，所配溶液的浓度偏小的是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"7\" size=\"7\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">填字母</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．转移溶液前容量瓶内有少量蒸馏水</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．定容摇匀后，发现液面下降，继续加水至刻度线</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．未洗涤烧杯及玻璃棒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．定容时，俯视刻度线</span></p></div></div></div>",
  "answer": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-answer\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861834-114651791852237200-7MrjRgE6btVeh61Wo8cFnNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXqtGA_o_FxwvCJbBp1-5Kpn\">（1）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><p style=\"\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/041d667fb30086cf46b96400bf44e6cd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（2）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><span>b</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（3）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><p style=\"\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f10bea617164151fddc18878f8d3d19e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>溶液（或氢氧化钠溶液）</span></p></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（4）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><p style=\"\"><span>4.2</span></p></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><p style=\"\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/76b3cc0f581fe41f1a8738427f05d2eb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>容量瓶</span></p></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><p style=\"\"><span>④</span></p></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><span>BC</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>",
  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861834-114651791852237200-7MrjRgE6btVeh61Wo8cFnNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXqtGA_o_FxwvCJbBp1-5Kpn\"><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"分析\">【分析】<p style=\"\"><span>装置甲为氯气发生装置，装置乙和丙为气体除杂装置（气体杂质包括氯化氢和水蒸气），装置丁为氯气收集装置；装置戊制备次氯酸钠，装置己为尾气处理，据此解答。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(1)小问详解： <p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">装置甲是实验室用二氧化锰和浓盐酸加热制取氯气的经典发生装置，反应生成氯化锰、氯气和水，该化学方程式为：&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a7afe352cd665758a5c3ecbe856b55e3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(2)小问详解： <p style=\"\"><span>氯气密度大于空气，用向上排空气法收集，气体要</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> “长管进、短管出”</span><span>，</span><span style=\"\">将瓶内空气从上方排出，</span><span>因此进气口为b；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(3)小问详解： <p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">氯气有毒，不能直接排放到空气中，装置己是尾气处理装置，需要用</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b111c41c444fb363891b3144d3eb20df.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"\">溶液吸收多余的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5d69d7191f7166d1c82e92bd9c6ef391.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"\">，防止污染环境；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(4)小问详解： <p style=\"\"><span>①</span><span style=\"\">原液的物质的量浓度：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ce7711e0411feb77631e238867516286.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"\">；实验室没有240 mL规格的容量瓶，需配制250 mL溶液，根据稀释定律</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/408fbbf6007a39acb8314004053fbf48.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"\">，得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3041e6a689cafad6f21b768d5d3cf5ba.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>②</span><span style=\"\">配制一定物质的量浓度溶液的核心仪器为对应规格的容量瓶，本题需选用250 mL容量瓶；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>③实验结束后，离开实验室前需用肥皂等清洗双手</span><span style=\"\">，对应的安全标识为④；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>④根据物质的量浓度定义式</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/68cd7921ae9339774aa6c5a184371531.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>，来判断误差：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>A．转移溶液前</span><span style=\"\">容量瓶内有少量蒸馏水，后续定容还需加水，对溶质物质的量和最终溶液体积均无影响，浓度不变</span><span>，A不符合题意； </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>B．</span><span style=\"\">定容摇匀后液面下降是正常现象。继续加水至刻度线，会导致溶液体积偏大，浓度偏小</span><span>，B符合题意； </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>C．</span><span style=\"\">未洗涤烧杯和玻璃棒，部分溶质残留，导致进入容量瓶的溶质物质的量偏小，浓度偏小</span><span>，C符合题意； </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>D．</span><span style=\"\">定容时俯视刻度线，视线从上方俯视会使实际加水量未达到刻度线，最终溶液体积偏小，浓度偏大</span><span>，D不符合题意； </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>故选BC。</span></p></div></div>",
